  <!-- ================= INTRO ================= -->
  <section class="intro">
    <p class="kicker"><b>The Unreal Human</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; theunrealhuman.tech</p>
    <h1>All Models</h1>
    <p>Explore our collection of hyperrealistic AI personas, each one with their own personality. Seven faces, seven distinct brand worlds — open a portrait to meet them. The same studio also builds AI automation for brands, so one face can carry a whole content system.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <h2>About — The Unreal Human</h2>
    <p>A brand-owned face is always available, always consistent — the same presence across every product, season and market, with no shoot days and no scheduling. Each persona is built once, then shaped around your product: a saree at noon, a rooftop at dusk, a candlelit table at night.</p>
    <p><b>AI models for brands</b> — Vaani, Ankit, Shreya, Devesh, Caroline, Shrishti and Genie are available for UGC, posters, product campaigns and social content, in stills and in 360&deg;.</p>
    <p><b>AI automation for brands</b> — the studio also sets up the systems behind the content: planning, production and publishing workflows that keep a brand posting consistently, without a shoot day for every post.</p>
    <p class="mono">One face · Every campaign · Always on brief — theunrealhuman.tech</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= BOOKING ================= -->
  <section class="book" id="book">
    <h2>Book a Model</h2>
    <p class="lead">Tell us which model you want and what she will be presenting — or choose AI automation if you want the systems behind the content. Fill this in and copy the enquiry — keep it ready to send.</p>
    <form id="enquiryForm">
      <div class="form-row">
        <div>
          <label for="fModel">Model or service</label>
          <select id="fModel">
            <option>Vaani Garg</option>
            <option>Ankit Nigam</option>
            <option>Shreya D'Cruze</option>
            <option>Devesh Nigam</option>
            <option>Caroline Langford</option>
            <option>Shrishti</option>
            <option>Genie</option>
            <option>AI automation for my brand</option>
            <option>AI models + automation</option>
            <option>Not sure yet — advise me</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="fBrand">Your brand</label>
          <input id="fBrand" type="text" placeholder="Brand or company name" autocomplete="organization" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="fProduct">Product / campaign</label>
        <input id="fProduct" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Festive saree collection launch" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="fMsg">Anything else?</label>
        <textarea id="fMsg" placeholder="Mood, timelines, where the content will run…"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="submit" id="copyBtn">Copy my enquiry</button>
      <p id="copyStatus" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <span>The Unreal Human · <a href="https://theunrealhuman.tech/">theunrealhuman.tech</a> — Vaani Garg · Ankit Nigam · Shreya D'Cruze · Devesh Nigam · Caroline Langford · Shrishti · Genie</span>
  <span>All models are AI-generated personas, created for brand campaigns.</span>
</footer>

